[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_02_0010","text":"冷冷冷冷，好冷～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_02_0020","text":"就是嘛——！\n耳朵和手都已经冻僵了——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_02_0030","text":"——啊，阳希酱——！\n看到那家店了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_02_0040","text":"真、真的呢～……\n快走吧～……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_02_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_02_0050","text":"……哈啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_02_0060","text":"饮料，好暖和呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_02_0070","text":"是啊——\n虽然想再多待一会儿——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_02_0080","text":"不赶紧出发的话，\n就赶不上下一个现场了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_02_0090","text":"——好……！这杯子的温暖……\n当作生命之火好好珍惜，加油赶路吧～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_02_0100","text":"哦——！"}]
